      "parameters": {
        "content": "## DG · ESP events\n**Purpose**: delivery / open / click / bounce / complaint for our digest emails (DG-6). The status is fetched from Resend by email id (verified), bounces and complaints disable the subscriber.\n**Input**: job {payload.event_id}.",
